00:15:52,543 --> 00:15:54,047
I must plant my seeds of light where the

254
00:15:54,130 --> 00:15:56,954
Destiny Stones once stood
and hope for the best.

255
00:15:57,110 --> 00:15:59,286
I've never had much of a green thong.

256
00:15:59,450 --> 00:16:01,097
What kind of seeds of light?

257
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:04,487
The seeds that will sprout and take on

258
00:16:04,570 --> 00:16:08,490
the same purpose as the Destiny Stones.

259
00:16:10,350 --> 00:16:11,327
That's a relief.

260
00:16:11,410 --> 00:16:15,127
And then the balance of the digital
world will be restored little by little.

261
00:16:15,210 --> 00:16:16,470
How about that, guys?

262
00:16:16,610 --> 00:16:17,440
We really did it.

263
00:16:17,523 --> 00:16:18,372
Looks that way.

264
00:16:18,610 --> 00:16:19,867
Now that's what I call...

265
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:20,780
Huh?

266
00:16:20,863 --> 00:16:21,693
What's wrong with you, Ken?

267
00:16:21,776 --> 00:16:22,730
Why so quiet? Nothing.

268
00:16:23,410 --> 00:16:26,947
Come on, if you've got something
to say, then just say it already.

269
00:16:27,030 --> 00:16:30,047
I was just thinking that we might
just have to find and destroy

270
00:16:30,130 --> 00:16:33,067
every single thing that has to
do with the powers of darkness.

271
00:16:33,150 --> 00:16:35,547
Otherwise, they will continue
to grow bigger and bigger.

272
00:16:35,630 --> 00:16:36,687
And before you know it,

273
00:16:36,770 --> 00:16:40,767
we'll have a bunch more creatures
like Black War Greymon roaming around.

274
00:16:40,850 --> 00:16:41,680
Oh, no, Ken!

275
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:43,650
You can't be serious, Ken!

276
00:16:44,010 --> 00:16:47,530
Ken understands the powers of
darkness more than any of us.

277
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:51,190
After all, he's the one that
first created Chimera Mon.

278
00:16:53,370 --> 00:16:55,429
I don't think that'll be necessary.

279
00:16:56,290 --> 00:16:57,120
Huh? What?

280
00:16:57,370 --> 00:17:00,723
I agree that the powers of
darkness are a terrible thing.

281
00:17:00,890 --> 00:17:03,147
And I think I speak
for all of us by saying

282
00:17:03,230 --> 00:17:05,107
it would be easier if they were destroyed.

283
00:17:05,190 --> 00:17:07,427
But I just don't think that it's possible.

284
00:17:07,510 --> 00:17:08,427
But why not?

285
00:17:08,510 --> 00:17:13,550
Because where there's light, you'll
always find darkness as well. TK's right.

286
00:17:13,690 --> 00:17:16,507
And the stronger the light is,
then the deeper the darkness.

287
00:17:16,590 --> 00:17:17,420
Exactly.

288
00:17:17,503 --> 00:17:20,667
So we have to remember that no matter
how the powers of darkness surround you,

289
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:23,467
the most important thing is
not to lose the light inside.

290
00:17:23,550 --> 00:17:24,887
But I don't understand.

291
00:17:24,970 --> 00:17:26,450
What is the light inside?

292
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:29,430
The light inside is hope.

293
00:17:30,010 --> 00:17:30,840
What?

294
00:17:30,923 --> 00:17:34,767
When all around you is darkness, you
must keep the light on inside your heart,

295
00:17:34,850 --> 00:17:36,767
no matter how high your
electric bill gets.

296
00:17:36,850 --> 00:17:38,909
It's the same as the Crest of Hope.

297
00:17:39,010 --> 00:17:40,327
The light in your heart?

298
00:17:40,410 --> 00:17:42,630
After the Dark Masters were defeated,

299
00:17:42,950 --> 00:17:47,830
those bearing the Crests of Light and
Hope were the ones that broke my seal.

300
00:17:48,250 --> 00:17:50,630
Hey, TK, those were our crests.

301
00:17:51,050 --> 00:17:54,462
When the Dark Digivice was
brought into the digital world,

302
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:57,207
the Harmonious Ones were
only able to find three

303
00:17:57,290 --> 00:18:01,550
Digimon who had the ancient power
of armor Digivolving. However,

304
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:04,927
the Digimon belonging to the
Digidestine with the Crests

305
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:08,330
of Light and Hope also were
capable of the same power.

306
00:18:08,830 --> 00:18:14,530
So, their Digivices took on new forms,
allowing them to armor Digivolve as well.

307
00:18:14,950 --> 00:18:16,610
Pegasmon and Nefertimon.

308
00:18:17,970 --> 00:18:22,890
These two Crests, Light and Hope,
are different from the others.

309
00:18:23,350 --> 00:18:26,710
The Crest of Courage, the Crest of Love,

310
00:18:27,230 --> 00:18:31,627
and the Crest of Knowledge come from the
power inside the Digidestin's hearts.

311
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:36,110
But the Crest of Light
gives life to this world.

312
00:18:36,690 --> 00:18:42,590
And the Crest of Hope continues to shine
no matter how darkness tries to hide it.

313
00:18:42,970 --> 00:18:46,130
Once all the DigiDestined
join their hearts together,

314
00:18:46,450 --> 00:18:50,310
the power was born and the
light shone even brighter,

315
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:54,670
giving the Digimon the
ability to Digibong.

316
00:18:55,110 --> 00:19:00,330
It is because of you, DigiDestined,
that the digital world still exists.

317
00:19:00,930 --> 00:19:01,990
But,

318
00:19:02,390 --> 00:19:09,270
even though Black Wargreymon is gone, and
my power will soon be restored, beware,

319
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:12,530
for the threat is not over.

320
00:19:12,930 --> 00:19:14,106
What are you saying?

321
00:19:14,370 --> 00:19:19,030
The evil that tried to seal
me away has not disappeared.

322
00:19:19,890 --> 00:19:22,830
Are you talking about
Arukinimon and Mummymon?

323
00:19:23,730 --> 00:19:26,110
No, they are merely pawns.

324
00:19:26,290 --> 00:19:29,230
There is an even greater
hatred in existence.

325
00:19:30,410 --> 00:19:33,387
You mean someone else is
controlling our Rukenny mod?

326
00:19:33,470 --> 00:19:35,567
Then that's who was controlling me, too.

327
00:19:35,650 --> 00:19:37,270
Your job is not finished.

328
00:19:37,650 --> 00:19:42,550
You must not stop until the digital
world is safe once and for all.

329
00:19:43,010 --> 00:19:46,187
We'll keep one eye on the Digi
world and one eye on our world.

330
00:19:46,270 --> 00:19:48,427
And we'll keep the
other eye on each other.

331
00:19:48,510 --> 00:19:49,830
You must be Davis.

332
00:19:50,170 --> 00:19:54,190
Well, despite him, I wish you
all good luck in your quest. Bye!

333
00:19:54,950 --> 00:19:55,780
Goodbye!

334
00:19:59,470 --> 00:20:02,287
Thanks to you, I'm able to
return to my restaurant.

335
00:20:02,370 --> 00:20:03,970
How about some treats?

336
00:20:04,250 --> 00:20:07,015
I know they're not much,
but take them, please.

337
00:20:08,330 --> 00:20:09,910
All right, free food!

338
00:20:10,630 --> 00:20:12,047
What's the matter with you, Davis?

339
00:20:12,130 --> 00:20:12,960
Didn't you see me?

340
00:20:13,043 --> 00:20:14,367
I was reaching for that one.

341
00:20:14,450 --> 00:20:16,450
They're all the same, aren't they?

342
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:17,920
Here, Ken.

343
00:20:18,003 --> 00:20:18,966
They're really good.

344
00:20:19,230 --> 00:20:20,877
Aren't you going to try one?

345
00:20:23,470 --> 00:20:24,588
Okay, I'll try one.

346
00:20:29,550 --> 00:20:30,430
Is it good?

347
00:20:35,930 --> 00:20:36,810
I agree.

348
00:20:37,250 --> 00:20:39,010
I said that one's mine!

349
00:20:43,590 --> 00:20:45,490
Those Chinese buns were great!

350
00:20:45,670 --> 00:20:47,141
You had one more than me.

351
00:20:47,270 --> 00:20:48,927
Well, I didn't know you were counting.

352
00:20:49,010 --> 00:20:50,047
Let me tell you something.

353
00:20:50,130 --> 00:20:52,365
When it comes to food, I always count.

354
00:20:56,030 --> 00:20:57,387
What are you looking at?

355
00:20:57,470 --> 00:21:01,147
Well, I'm not exactly sure, but I
think I just saw a control spire.

356
00:21:01,230 --> 00:21:03,547
You should try wearing those
goggles once in a while.

357
00:21:03,630 --> 00:21:04,460
Control spire?

358
00:21:04,543 --> 00:21:05,373
Yeah, right.

359
00:21:06,990 --> 00:21:08,650
I don't care what Yoli says.

360
00:21:08,810 --> 00:21:09,869
I know what I saw.

361
00:21:25,410 --> 00:21:27,528
The car goes on the road to the car,

362
00:21:28,490 --> 00:21:30,196
the car is a straight-to-air.

363
00:21:31,950 --> 00:21:34,650
I'm just going to turn back on the road,

364
00:21:35,710 --> 00:21:36,651
I'm so confused.

365
00:21:39,190 --> 00:21:44,670
I'm going to connect with the hands
together, and I'm going to drive together.

366
00:21:55,570 --> 00:22:00,967
I'll always say it's true.

367
00:22:01,050 --> 00:22:02,850
You can always say it's true.

368
00:22:03,170 --> 00:22:08,390
I'll always say it's true.

369
00:22:09,450 --> 00:22:11,590
I'm so sorry.
